From: B Honey <9922368+Mhsbrian@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 13:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ANYBOOK: wallpaper preview: a granted fullscreen request does
 not crash

WallpaperPreviewActivity.requestFullscreen() passes an
OutcomeReceiver<Void, Throwable> whose onResult() takes a non-null Void.
FullscreenRequestHandler reports success as onResult(null), so Kotlin's
parameter check threw a NullPointerException and killed
com.android.wallpaper whenever the preview, opened in a desktop
(freeform) window, was granted fullscreen.

Seen on the ROG Zephyrus G14 (OpenBook anal192d, 2026-10-18 11:05:07Z),
4 s after the owner opened a wallpaper preview from Wallpaper & style:
java.lang.NullPointerException: Parameter specified as non-null is null:
method ...WallpaperPreviewActivity$requestFullscreen$1.onResult
  at WallpaperPreviewActivity$requestFullscreen$1.onResult(WallpaperPreviewActivity.kt:276)
  at android.app.FullscreenRequestHandler.notifyFullscreenRequestResult(FullscreenRequestHandler.java:159)

Take a nullable Void, as the framework delivers it.
---
 .../wallpaper/picker/preview/ui/WallpaperPreviewActivity.kt  | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/com/android/wallpaper/picker/preview/ui/WallpaperPreviewActivity.kt b/src/com/android/wallpaper/picker/preview/ui/WallpaperPreviewActivity.kt
index 69d704887..947df13e8 100644
--- a/src/com/android/wallpaper/picker/preview/ui/WallpaperPreviewActivity.kt
+++ b/src/com/android/wallpaper/picker/preview/ui/WallpaperPreviewActivity.kt
@@ -273,8 +273,9 @@ class WallpaperPreviewActivity :
     private fun requestFullscreen(request: Int, onError: ((Throwable) -> Unit)? = null) {
         requestFullscreenMode(
             request,
-            object : OutcomeReceiver<Void, Throwable> {
-                override fun onResult(result: Void) {
+            object : OutcomeReceiver<Void?, Throwable> {
+                // FullscreenRequestHandler reports success as onResult(null).
+                override fun onResult(result: Void?) {
                     Log.v(TAG, "requestFullscreenMode $request success")
                 }
 
